# --- Unreal Engine generierte Ordner ---
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Build/

# Platform-spezifischer Build-Kram
Platforms/*/Binaries/
Platforms/*/Intermediate/

# --- Visual Studio / Rider / IDE ---
.vs/
.vsconfig
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# --- Compiled / temporäre Dateien ---
*.tmp
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ipch

# --- Plugins: Binaries und Intermediate ausschließen, Content behalten ---
Plugins/**/Binaries/
Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# --- Betriebssystem-Müll ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Lokale Unreal-Dateien ---
*.uatbuildrecord
*.tps